#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select zero or more options from the <guilabel>Options</guilabel> "
"section. Each option has a tooltip with a hint on what effect it has."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Parameters"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add zero or more parameters via the <guilabel>LibXSLT Parameters</"
"guilabel> section of dialog. This allows you to provide parameter values to "
"the stylesheet."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example you could click the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button and enter "
"a parameter <guilabel>Name</guilabel> of <parameter>myparam</parameter> with "
"a parameter <guilabel>Value</guilabel> of <parameter>'Hello World!'</"
"parameter>. To update the name or value of an existing parameter select it "
"with the &LMB;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apply Changes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the changes you have made to take effect press the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button and close the dialog. To ignore any changes press the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you need to change the configuration just re-open the configuration "
"dialog as shown before."
msgstr ""

