#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The state of a given breakpoint is indicated via the relevant text with a "
"different background color. You can choose the color desired: see the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Editor</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> dialog, on the <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set, disable or delete a breakpoint using keys, the <guimenu>Debug</"
"guimenu> menu or the buttons on the tool bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can move the cursor around the text using the following keys:"
msgstr ""

