#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With &kxsldbg; Output"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the output from &kxsldbg; is captured and presented either in the "
"inspectors dialog or the &kxsldbg; output window. The exceptions to this "
"rule are:"
